### Test 1: one user by id
GET http://localhost:8301/users/42

### Test 2: a list of users
GET http://localhost:8301/users?limit=50

### Test 3: a new user with three posts
POST http://localhost:8301/users
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "posts": [
    { "title": "First", "body": "Hello" },
    { "title": "Second", "body": "Again" },
    { "title": "Third", "body": "Done" }
  ]
}

### Test 4: a user with posts and comments
GET http://localhost:8301/users/42/feed

### Test 5: one query for each post
GET http://localhost:8301/users/42/feed-loop
